 CBUpload args;p;parent;obj;leaf;src;t;b64;name;type;bytes;ext;tn
 ⍝ Handle uploads - of new Member list or a new Document

 p←'.'⍳⍨⌽obj←1⊃args                          ⍝ These two lines
 parent←(-p)↓obj ⋄ leaf←(1-p)↑obj            ⍝     should be replaced by utilities

 src←parent,'.ULU' '.ULD'⊃⍨'UD'⍳mode←⊃⌽leaf  ⍝ Translate button name to name of Upload control
 (t #.EWC.LOGMODES)←#.EWC.LOGMODES''         ⍝ Turn off EWC logging: don't dump file contents to session
 (b64 name type)←src eWG'FileBytes' 'FileName' 'FileType' ⍝ The upload actuall happens now
 #.EWC.LOGMODES←t                            ⍝ Restore logging

 :If 0∊≢¨b64 name type
     →0⊣DisplayPopup'Upload' 'Fik ikke hentet filen - prøv at vælge den igen' 'Error' 'OK'
 :EndIf

 bytes←EWC.Base64.Decode b64                 ⍝ /// Agreed with Neil Base64.Decode should become unnecessary
 ext←(-'.'⍳⍨⌽name)↑name
 1 ⎕NDELETE tempfile←ROOT,'/Data/temp',ext
 tn←tempfile ⎕NCREATE 0
 bytes ⎕NAPPEND tn 80                        ⍝ Transfer incoming bytes to temp file
 ⎕NUNTIE tn

 :Select mode
 :Case 'U' ⍝ Users
     UpdateMemberFile tempfile

 :Case 'D' ⍝ New Document
     t←(parent,'.ULDOKNAME')eWG 'Text' ⍝ The name that the user wants to give the file on the server
     t ProcessNewDocument tempfile
 :EndSelect
